 inje\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\u2022 Modo Livre\nExplore o modelo 3D em escala real, visualize cada componente individualmente, assista \u00e0 anima\u00e7\u00e3o completa do ciclo de inje\u00e7\u00e3o e entenda o papel de cada pe\u00e7a no processo.\n\n\u2022 Exerc\u00edcios Interativos\nIdentifica\u00e7\u00e3o de Pe\u00e7as: associe corretamente os nomes aos componentes.\nSepara\u00e7\u00e3o por Conjunto: organize as partes entre conjunto fixo e m\u00f3vel.\n\nAo final, o aluno recebe um feedback completo, com tempo de execu\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00famero de acertos e erros - ideal para refor\u00e7ar o aprendizado de forma pr\u00e1tica e envolvente.\nTransforme o estudo de moldes de inje\u00e7\u00e3o em uma experi\u00eancia imersiva e did\u00e1tica com a tecnologia da realidade aumentada!", "short_description": "Molde de inje\u00e7\u00e3o em realidade virtual: aprenda interagindo com o modelo 3D!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EE7lD0fcJuDOY6ybyPjOFVu_c1_QnbK5/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SENAI", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sc.senai.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25756999213906835"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "i